      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JACKY LEGS (1) comes off an average performance last start when sixth at this track over 520m behind Royal Bandit (30.16) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Looks the one to beat on his best form. FREDDY LIVE WIRE (7) goes very well at the course with two wins and a placing from five starts. Missed the frame latest (20.98) when fourth over 365m at this track in a Grade 5. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. UNSTOPPABLE MIST (4) missed the frame last time but had been racing well prior to that, winning a Grade 5 three back before a placing at this track the following run. Can turn it around this time. MANEUVER EXPRESS (5) will make her presence felt following a brief layoff.",
